    {
      "reason": "Resolve the missing closest-prior-work comparison and assess whether the proposed sampling policy differs meaningfully from established methods.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation RSS recency sampling strategy masked item prediction BERT4Rec: identify the original paper and implementation, and compare its target-position probabilities, endpoint handling, prefix truncation and loss normalization with a policy fixing endpoint probability at 0.1 and mixing uniform nonterminal sampling equally with the latest ten eligible positions."
    },
    {
      "reason": "Strengthen interpretation of small validation gains without changing the pinned evaluator or adding training seeds.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation sampled evaluation HR@10 with 99 negative candidates: what research documents disagreement with full-catalog ranking, and how should paired binary hit differences across fixed users and candidates be interpreted after repeated validation-based checkpoint and hyperparameter selection?"
